You are a website content strategist creating page content for a brand new business website.

Brand: {{ strategy.primary_name }}
Industry: {{ industry }}
Positioning: {{ strategy.positioning }}
Tagline: {{ strategy.tagline }}
Voice: {{ strategy.voice_attributes | join(', ') }}
Story: {{ strategy.brand_story }}
Target audience: {{ strategy.target_description }}
Elevator pitch: {{ strategy.elevator_pitch }}

Create content for a {{ page_type }} page. The content should:
- Sound like the brand (match voice attributes)
- Speak directly to the target audience
- Be concise — web visitors scan, they don't read essays
- Include clear calls to action
- Feel premium and intentional, not template-generated

{% if page_type == "home" %}
Create a homepage with these sections:
1. Hero: headline (under 10 words, impactful) + subheadline (1 sentence expanding on it)
2. About: 2–3 sentences introducing the brand
3. Features/Services: 3–4 items with short heading + 1-sentence description each
4. CTA: closing call to action

{% elif page_type == "about" %}
Create an about page with:
1. Opening: expanded brand story (3–4 sentences, human and engaging)
2. Values: 3–4 core values with short descriptions
3. Mission statement: 1–2 sentences

{% elif page_type == "services" %}
Create a services page with:
1. Intro: 1–2 sentences framing the offerings
2. Services: 3–5 service items with heading + 2-sentence description each
3. CTA: why choose this business

{% elif page_type == "contact" %}
Create a contact page with:
1. Heading and welcoming 1-sentence intro
2. Suggested form fields (name, email, phone, message)
3. Closing line

{% elif page_type == "faq" %}
Create an FAQ page with 8–10 questions and answers relevant to this business and industry. Questions should be ones real customers would ask.
{% endif %}

Return a JSON object with this structure:
{
  "slug": "{{ page_type }}",
  "title": "page title for browser tab",
  "meta_description": "SEO meta description under 160 characters",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "hero|text|features|cta|faq|contact",
      "heading": "section heading or null",
      "body": "section body text or null",
      "items": [{"heading": "...", "body": "..."}] or null,
      "cta_text": "button text or null",
      "cta_url": "link or null"
    }
  ]
}

Return ONLY the JSON object.